{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまうす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構前にベリとぱんけーき食べに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと食べたかったぱんけーきを食べに行きました⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どぅーーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYQ1AANY0X0KC4C0S9S376","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しすぎた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう。ふわふわ。また食べたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ね。マカロン食べた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日またガルボのキャラメル味食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれははまっちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近無性にチョコレートが食べたくなる。｡o@(･_･)@o｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪切りたいって思ったけど、今は伸ばしたくなった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なみがはげしい。困る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}